{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066209/block/singleImage/3280810/wm/01M8G96MGR4MH8WQC8NZZFJMKW.jpeg?updatedAt=1795843006\"/><figcaption>天文台表示，周六大致天晴及非常乾燥。(《am730》記者攝)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台表示，周六（27日）大致天晴及非常乾燥，東北季候風正為華南帶來晴朗的天氣，今早本港大部分地區的相對濕度下降至百分之40左右。最高氣溫約27度，吹和緩北至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁，高地達強風程度。 天文台展望隨後兩三日大致天晴，周日（28日）風勢頗大，下周中後期日間相當溫暖。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1066209/block/singleImage/3280812/df/01M8FYV9111H3192H625V223TM.png?updatedAt=1795843006\"/><figcaption>天文台展望隨後兩三日大致天晴</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:34:10.505506+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T02:14:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T09:50:18.560669+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:27:21.235290+00:00","content_hash":"ea07dc0d9c5ffe072534cf2de5b0a1a7e8a8d49a36a0ac1394a4dbb7e4dd9925","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}